221   810B B7                   OR      A
222   810C C8                   RET     Z
223   810D D3 EF                OUT     ($EF),A
224   810F 23                   INC     HL
225   8110 18 F8                JR      DebugPrint
226   8112
227   8112 00           CurrentBank: DB 0
