254   8265              ; TR-DOS BASIC loader. Loads VGATEST.C at 8000h and starts it.
255   8265              ; =========================================================================
256   8265                      ORG     $B000
257   B000              CLEAR       EQU $FD
258   B000              LOAD        EQU $EF
